MODULE: RejectCountsDemand
TARGET: RejectedDemandUnchanged
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: a refused operation inflates admitted demand
PERTURBS: Reject

--- FIND
Reject(s) ==
    /\ s \in live
    /\ configured[s]
    /\ now < tat[s] - tolerance[s]
    /\ UNCHANGED vars
--- REPLACE
Reject(s) ==
    /\ s \in live
    /\ configured[s]
    /\ now < tat[s] - tolerance[s]
    /\ demand' = [demand EXCEPT ![s] = @ + 1]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<live, rate, changed, joined, left, restarted, now, phase, cycles,
                   age, grant, configured, emission, tolerance, tat, cancelled>>
--- END
